dataSetInformation.common:generalComment:
Maunfacturing process starting with natural gas, air and electricity is considered, plus auxiliaries, energy, transportation, infrastructure and land use, as well as wastes and emissions into air and water. Transport of the raw materials, auxiliaries and wastes is included, transport and storage of the product are not included. Carbon Dioxide is the byproduct generated. Transcient or unstable operations are not considered, but the production during stable operation conditions. Emissions to air are considered as emanating in a high population density area. Emissions into water are assumed to be emitted into rivers. Values are taken principally from EFMA 2000 and Frischknecht 1999 (see report). Inventory refers to 1 kg 100% ammonia, liquid, at plant.;
CAS number: 007664-41-7; 
Formula: NH3; 
UUID: 74d7a504-c37d-309b-b896-6ead68d8a38e
